4	4	4
5	5	5
6	6	6
7	7	7
8	8	8
9	9	9
EXPLAIN FORMAT=tree SELECT /*+ PQ(t2 64) */ * FROM t
JOIN t t2 ON t.i = t2.i
JOIN t t3 on t2.i = t3.i
ORDER BY t.i, t2.i, t3.i;
EXPLAIN
-> Sort: t.i, t2.i, t3.i
    -> Stream results  (cost=*** rows=***)
        -> Gather: 64 workers, parallel scan on t, t2  (cost=*** rows=***)
            -> Table scan on <temporary>  (cost=*** rows=***)
                -> Temporary table  (cost=*** rows=***)
                    -> Inner hash join, one hash table per worker (t3.i = t.i)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                        -> Table scan on t3  (cost=*** rows=***)
                        -> Hash
                            -> Inner hash join, hash table shared by worker threads (t2.i = t.i)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                -> Parallel table scan on t2  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                -> Hash
                                    -> Parallel table scan on t  (cost=*** rows=***)

