# Test for semi/anti/outer hash join
# Test parallel hash join. For semi/anti/outer hash join, it just
# can choose probe table as divided table. If the build table is
# considered small or is not suitable as cut table, it will be
# executed as parallel-oblivious hash join. If the build table is
# considered large or is suitable as cut table, it will be executed
# as parallel-aware hash join with building a shared hash table.
